{"time": "2026-06-08T22:56:47", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_005", "post_id": "nn1rbck", "subreddit": "worldnews", "content": "Is anyone else watching how the story on Ukraine aid changes every other week? One minute it's an absolute emergency and they'll go under tomorrow if we don't send another billion, and the next it's 'less urgent' because some other news cycle took over. It's impossible to get a straight answer on what's actually happening over there."}
{"time": "2026-06-08T22:56:47", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_007", "post_id": "nehkm9j", "subreddit": "InternationalNews", "content": "Is anyone else watching these global port strikes and getting tired of how they're reported? Every headline is just complaining about supply chain delays and price hikes, completely ignoring why the workers are actually striking in the first place. It's always about the corporate bottom line, never about fair wages or working conditions."}
{"time": "2026-06-08T22:57:13", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_006", "post_id": "4ytq3ca", "subreddit": "news", "content": "Is anyone else tired of the constant 'could face' and 'potentially planning' headlines regarding European defense procurement? Every other article about NATO or EU defense budgets relies on non-binding pledges or 10-year projections instead of actual, signed contracts. If you look at the actual delivery schedules for major systems, the numbers are way lower than the press releases suggest. We need to stop treating political promises as completed deals."}
{"time": "2026-06-08T22:57:13", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_008", "post_id": "1awdzc9", "subreddit": "news", "content": "How do they actually count refugees? One news site says 6 million left Ukraine, but another says it's closer to 8 million, and then some other source claims half of them have already gone back. It feels like everyone is just making up numbers at this point to fit whatever narrative they're pushing."}
{"time": "2026-06-08T22:57:13", "event": "comment1_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_002", "post_id": "nehkm9j", "comment_id": "i0yg6vz", "target_author": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_007"}
