{"time": "2026-06-08T22:57:13", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g002_a03_e67a6eae_001", "post_id": "ib1f1kr", "subreddit": "news", "content": "Is anyone else just tired of how binary foreign policy debates have become lately? It feels like you have to pick a side like a football match, and pointing out the messiness or historical context just gets you labeled as an apologist by both sides. It’s exhausting trying to find any actual nuance or reasonable discussion anymore."}
